  "summary": "Hi my name is Joshua Nguyen, I have a B.S. in Computer Science from the University of Texas at Dallas, and I am currently working at General Motors as a Software Developer.\n\nCoding has been one of the more fun things I have picked up from school. It was originally a hobby of mine, since I really wanted to follow the Asian stereotype of becoming a doctor. Shortly after I started college, I slowly learned that a job in the medical field wasn't fit for me. Instead, I wanted to explore computer science and turn this hobby of mine into a passion. \n\nLearning how to code was a big challenge and I never would have thought it would have taken me this far. The fun part about it is there is so much more to learn and the possibilities are limitless!",
